只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Anchored-standard agent preset for DeepSeek Harness: Minimal-aligned first request, low-injection post-promotion, indirect AGENTS.md loading — anchored intelligence without the IQ drop. （DeepSeek Harness 的锚定标准预设：首轮 Minimal 对齐、晋升后低注入、AGENTS.md 间接按需加载——锚定智力不降智。）","id":"gh:1335344648","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-anchored-flash","slug":"ruler770525/dsh-anchored-flash","topics":["agent-preset","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Anchored-standard agent preset for DeepSeek Harness: Minimal-aligned first request, low-injection po"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"st-promotion, indirect AGENTS.md loading — anchored intelligence without the IQ drop. （DeepSeek Harn"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ess 的锚定标准预设：首轮 Minimal 对齐、晋升后低注入、AGENTS.md 间接按需加载——锚定智力不降智。）"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-anchored-flash"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"An experimental DeepSeek Harness agent preset: **Minimal-aligned anchoring with\nlow-injection post-p"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"romotion, an indirect AGENTS.md injection pattern, and\nsubagent anchoring** — the \"anchored intellig"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ence without the IQ drop\"\nexperiment series."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Fork of `xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard`\nwith local modifications; the experiment report is in\nups"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ght/dsh-anchored-standard`\nwith local modifications; the experiment report is in\nupstream issue #49."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> **Maintenance status (2026-08-17)**: upstream\n> `xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard`\n> has entered m"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"aintenance mode (FAREWELL — the official API price change made\n> the experiment series cost-prohibit"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ive). This repository, an experiment\n> branch of that series, is **frozen**: it no longer tracks ups"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"tream, and the\n> experiment conclusions live in\n> upstream issue #49.\n> Related work has moved to th"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"e `zhu1090093659/dsh-web-ui` ecosystem (the\n> non-assertive AGENTS.md hint, `instructionHint`, was m"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"erged there as #388).\n> Local installs keep working; no further releases are planned here."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## What makes this different from upstream"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Feature | Upstream `anchored-standard` | This preset |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| First request | Minimal pair `bash` + `str_replace_editor`, maxTokens 1024, zero injected context "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"| same |\n| System prompt after promotion | `complete: true` persona, stays the Minimal sentence (46 "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"chars) forever | same, enforced by the assemble filter in every phase (`tool-bootstrap`) |\n| Post-pr"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"omotion catalog | bootstrap pair + discovery tools + `dev_tool_search` unlocks | configurable **`res"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"identTools` whitelist** (default: 18 tools incl. memory/dtodo/web_search/de_session/read_image/exit_"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"plan_mode/skill_search/skill_load) |\n| `instruction-hint` wording | imperative (\"read the relevant i"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"nstruction files **first and follow them**\") — **measured to flip the anchored trajectory back to \"l"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"et me\"** | neutral/suggestive reference note — **measured to preserve \"we\"** (see experiment table b"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"elow) |\n| Subagents | opt-in `includeSubagents` | **default `true`** — subagents go through the same"},{"id":"p9s10","text":" anchor flow |\n| AGENTS.md | full digest injection (perturbs) or nothing | **indirect injection**: 1"},{"id":"p9s11","text":" KB topic index + `AGENTS-*.md` topic files + `env-*` skills, read on demand (`skill_load` / `read`)"},{"id":"p9s12","text":" — measured non-perturbing |\n| Windows bash | `custom-bash` (fixed path) | `custom-bash` with **PATH"},{"id":"p9s13","text":" fallback** when the configured Git Bash path is missing |\n| Runtime context (memory snapshot etc.) "},{"id":"p9s14","text":"| stripped | stripped in every phase (low-injection) |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Experiment summary (measured 2026-08-16, DeepSeek V4 Pro, reasoningEffort=max)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Fingerprint = completed-reasoning counts of `we` / `let's` / `let me`\n(case-insensitive, whole words"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"). Sessions are real DSH sessions on Windows +\nrc.6."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Exp | Hint wording | System prompt | Result |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| baseline | imperative (\"read first and follow them\") | restored to standard (46→6620 chars) | **we"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"→let me flip after promotion** (0 we / 3 let me; model: \"I must read relevant instructions\") |\n| E1 "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"| neutral reference note | 46 chars in every phase | `we` preserved (up to 49 we / 1 let me in 22.5k"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"-char analyses) |\n| E2 | neutral + user asked to read AGENTS.md | 46 chars | full on-demand chain wa"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"lked (`skill_search` → `skill_load` → `read` 1 KB index); `we` preserved; environment facts actually"},{"id":"p13s6","text":" used |\n| E1.5 | suggestive (\"reading the index is recommended\") | 46 chars | `we` preserved; model "},{"id":"p13s7","text":"reads only when the task needs environment facts |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Key conclusions:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"1. **The promoted system-prompt mutation (46→6620 chars) is itself a\nperturbation.** Keep the system"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" prompt at the single Minimal sentence in\nevery phase.\n2. **Imperative wording in a user-role inject"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ed message correlates with the\nstyle switch** (we report correlation, not mechanism).\n3. **Non-imper"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"ative reference wording does not flip the trajectory**, and\nread willingness is driven by task need,"},{"id":"p15s5","text":" not hint wording.\n4. **Anchored intelligence and AGENTS.md availability are not mutually\nexclusive*"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"*: tell the model (non-imperatively) that reference documents\nexist, and let it load them on demand."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Restart DeepSeek Harness, create a fresh session, pick **锚定标准·满血子代理**\n(`anchored-flash`). Do not swi"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"tch presets mid-session."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Recommended AGENTS.md layout (the indirect-injection pattern)"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Split the user-global `~/.dsh/AGENTS.md` into:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- `~/.dsh/AGENTS.md` — ~1 KB topic index (3 iron rules + pointer table)\n- `~/.dsh/AGENTS-<topic>.md`"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" — topic files (environment / network / dsh /\nworkflow / browser …)\n- `~/.dsh/skills/env-*` — the sa"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"me content as skills, discoverable via\n`skill_search` and loadable via `skill_load`"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Verify"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT. The preset is based on the DeepSeek Harness Standard preset and on\n`xiaobright/dsh-anchored-sta"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ndard`; see `NOTICE` and\n`LICENSE`. Part of the experiment design and this documentation\nwere assist"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ed by DeepSeek (an AI assistant); all measurements are from real\nDSH sessions."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
